{
  "source": "Phase-1 regression set (iter-13 validation beats): full narrator response documents distilled from the live agent-in-the-loop session (seed 125, log logs/run_125_0.jsonl - a gitignored runtime artifact; provenance worklog iter-13). Each case replays through the REAL mediator cycle (Simulator + Mediator + SceneLedger, cli/mediator.py) - not the validator or the gateway in isolation: the beat-level pins behind the phase-1 exit criterion '0 canon violations per 100 beats' (ROADMAP 2). The string 'anchor' in expected_event_seq / based_on_event_seq resolves to the anchor the emitted call advertised (the narrator's contract, BRIEF_SPEC 7.1); integers pass through. Expectations: status + note substrings (+ optional last_event_type, log_unchanged vs the emit moment, call_contains on a final emit).",
